<b>
<a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=89&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Training Exercises.</a></b><hr>
One think I will say about Tenacity, we are suborn as hell regardless of what the reward is.   We've spent three days and quite a few deaths trying to figure out the Sand Tower boss mob enounter (we dont want your tactics, finding this stuff out on your own is just damn fun).   There is are basically three level 65 bad ass named pets tied to the main boss and you have to deal with all four at once.   We tried many different ways of dealing with him.  I've wanted to break a few keyboards over the frustration of the fight.  FINALLY last night after our second attempt:<br />
<br />
<A HREF="http://www.tenacityguild.com/images/news/tower.jpg"><img src="http://www.tenacityguild.com/images/news/tower.jpg" border=0 width=320 height=240></A><br />
<br />
Good work guys.   After this fight we did the very fun Lightning encounter again but this time tried to cut a few corners and just pull the boss with all of the mobs around the arena up.   Well Rayyn died (the puller) after the Boss ran around the entire arena inviting 5 or 6 adds.   Damn fine work Split Tanks and Enchanters getting this fight completed with minimal loss in numbers.   Having a boss that rampages, and 6 mobs who can kill 8.5k tanks in no time at all in camp at the same time is seriously fun shit.<br />
<br />
What was the loot?   Wasn't anything worth mentioning - but DAMN ITS FUN!   The training is great though, but I am certain most of the guild would like to kill me for making them do these annoying towers over and over.<BR><BR>
